{"title": "Swires' Sledboard", "pageid": 11554, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Swires'_Sledboard", "categories": ["Bugs", "Shields", "Very rare items", "Sources of damage reduction", "Force set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Swires_sledboard.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Swires_sledboard.png/300px-Swires_sledboard.png.webp, /w/images/4/45/Swires_sledboard.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Swires' Sledboard image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/45/Swires_sledboard.png/300px-Swires_sledboard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/45/Swires_sledboard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Swires' Sledboard</span></a> is a very rare shield that grants the wearer <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Conduit_(Condition)\" title=\"Force Conduit (Condition)\">Force Conduit</a> at the start of combat. It also grants <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Bash\" title=\"Shield Bash\">Shield Bash</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A <a href=\"/wiki/Lupperdiddle_Swires\" title=\"Lupperdiddle Swires\">gnomish adventurer</a> once used this to outpace his enemies down a slope.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n <div class=\"bg3wiki-ac-value\" style=\"grid-template-columns: 42px; 1fr\">\n<div><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/60px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/80px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png/40px-Armour_class_icon_frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/87/Armour_class_icon_frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ac-value\" aria-label=\"Armour class: +2\">+2</div>\n<div class=\"ac-value-comment\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" title=\"Shields\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/25px-Shields_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/38px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/50px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shields\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/25px-Shields_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shields_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">Shields</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Proficiency Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png/28px-Proficiency_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Proficiency_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Required Proficiency: <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" title=\"Shields\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/25px-Shields_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/38px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/50px-Shields_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shields\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/af/Shields_Icon.png/25px-Shields_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/af/Shields_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shields\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Shields\">Shields</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 2.7 kg (5.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 2.7 kg (5.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 360 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  360  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Steadfast_Shield</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Steadfast_Shield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Steadfast_Shield\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">1cee750f-79c6-4109-8272-d27b97ef02df</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1cee750f-79c6-4109-8272-d27b97ef02df\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:1cee750f-79c6-4109-8272-d27b97ef02df\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Steadfast_Shield</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Steadfast_Shield+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Steadfast_Shield+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Blow\" title=\"Shield Blow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/60px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/80px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shield Blow\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp/40px-Shield_Bash_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Shield_Bash_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Blow\" title=\"Shield Blow\">Shield Blow</a> (<span aria-label=\"Reaction\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaction\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>When a foe hits you with a melee attack, you can use your reaction to knock it <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a></span>, unless they succeed a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">saving throw</a>. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Shield_Conduit\" title=\"Shield Conduit\">Shield Conduit</a></dt><dd>The shield shrouds the wearer with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Force_Conduit_(Condition)\" title=\"Force Conduit (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Force Conduit\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Force_Conduit_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Force_Conduit_(Condition)\" title=\"Force Conduit (Condition)\">Force Conduit</a> at the start of its turn in combat.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Rivington_General\" title=\"Rivington General\">Rivington General</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;7&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-35</span>: Sold by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/25px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/38px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/50px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Exxvikyap\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png/25px-Portrait_Exxvikyap.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Portrait_Exxvikyap.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Exxvikyap\" title=\"Exxvikyap\">Exxvikyap</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Rivington\" title=\"Rivington\">Rivington</a> during <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Three\" title=\"Act Three\">Act Three</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>One of several references to the gnome adventurer Lupperdiddle Swires. Others appear in the descriptions of the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting\" title=\"Potion of Glorious Vaulting\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/POT_Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Glorious_Vaulting\" title=\"Potion of Glorious Vaulting\">Potion of Glorious Vaulting</a>, <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arsonist%27s_Oil\" title=\"Arsonist's Oil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/de/Coat_Arsonist%27s_Oil_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arsonist%27s_Oil\" title=\"Arsonist's Oil\">Arsonist's Oil</a> and <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Swiresy_Shoes\" title=\"Swiresy Shoes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a9/Shoes_D_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Swiresy_Shoes\" title=\"Swiresy Shoes\">Swiresy Shoes</a>. \"Swires\" is a <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_references\" title=\"Cultural references\">reference</a> to the <a href=\"/wiki/Cultural_references#Discworld\" title=\"Cultural references\">Discworld</a> books.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Shield Conduit:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Shield Conduit actually applies 2 turns of Force Conduit per turn, not 1 as the tooltip implies. However, as Force Conduit loses duration at the start of each turn, it appears that only 1 turn is applied.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n\n<p><i>Regarding Shield Conduit:</i></p>\n<ul><li>Shield Conduit is missing code found in other Force Conduit passives that applies a visual effect on the wielder when receiving turns of Force Conduit.</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-packed\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 356px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 354px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg/531px-Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg/797px-Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg/1061px-Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Concept art by Jane Katsubo\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg/531px-Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"354\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Jane-katsubo-shield.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art by Jane Katsubo</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202348\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.101 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.109 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3550/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 54509/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15057/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip